      "formula": "\\int f\\,dJ=0\\Rightarrow f_P\\in H_P^0,\\quad B^*i_\\perp f_\\perp=i_0\\Gamma_0f_V=\\Gamma_Pi_0f_V,\\quad\\|f\\|^2=\\|f_P\\|^2+\\|f_\\perp\\|^2.",
